YieldcoinShare_upgradeToAndCall
├── when caller has UPGRADER_ROLE
│   ├── it should succeed
│   └── it should preserve metadata, CCIP admin, balances, supply, allowances, pause state, default admin, and roles
├── when caller does not have UPGRADER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when called on the implementation directly
│   └── it should revert with UUPSUnauthorizedCallContext
├── when the new implementation has no code
│   └── it should revert
├── when the new implementation returns an invalid proxiable UUID
│   └── it should revert with UUPSUnsupportedProxiableUUID
└── when re-initializing the proxy after upgrade
    └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
